# The build context of deploy/docker/aegis/Dockerfile is the root of the repository.
# This file is an allow list: the context has only the files that the build of the
# `aegis` program reads. A change to a different file does not start a new build.
#
# The image in deploy/docker/postgres has its own context. This file does not apply to it.

# Ignore all files.
*

# The Cargo workspace.
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/

# The build compares the Rust version of the build image with this file.
!rust-toolchain.toml

# Files that the crates embed at compile time: the starter directory of `aegis init`, the
# recorded attack log of `aegis demo`, and the interface of the connector plugins.
!detections/
!policies/
!playbooks/
!fixtures/
!wit/

# The license text goes into the image.
!LICENSE

# Never send these files, also if a line above permits their directory.
**/.git
**/.worktrees
**/target
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.rs.bk
**/.DS_Store
